===Etymology===
From {{der|en|enm|driven}}, from {{der|en|ang|drīfan||to drive, force, move}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*drīban}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*drībaną||to drive}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dʰreybʰ-||to drive, push}}.

{{rel-top|Cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|drive||to drive}}, {{cog|frr|driwe||to drive}}, {{cog|stq|drieuwe||to drive}}, {{cog|fy|driuwe||to chase, drive, impel}}, {{cog|nl|drijven||to drive}}, {{cog|nds|drieven||to drive, drift, push}}, {{cog|de|treiben||to drive, push, propel}}, {{cog|nb|drive}}, {{cog|da|drive||to drive, run, force}}, {{cog|nn|driva}}, {{cog|sv|driva||to drive, power, drift, push, force}}, {{cog|is|drífa||to drive, hurry, rush}}. {{rel-bottom}}

